  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/he-p/309",
  "definition": "Influenza Vaccination Rates",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-11",
  "historyNote": "#9851, eff 1-14-11; amd by #10079, eff 1-26-12 (from He-P 309.07); ss by #12943, eff 12-11-19 (formerly He-P 309.08); renumbered by #13282, INTERIM (formerly He-P 309.12) (see Revision Note at part heading for He-P 309)",
